# Experiment records are not part of the framework. Individual sweeps -- their
# drivers, task-set copies, plans, result trees and paper output -- are working
# records of one study, not something a borrower of this repo needs or can use.
# The reusable half lives in scripts/run_experiment.sh, which drives whatever
# experiments/<name>/inputs/run.sh happens to be on disk.
